ves  samuel can carry out the mission due to  his loyalty even though he came from  ansi  general yun tells samal to rejoin the  army in the capital after completing his  mission  on his way to ansi samuel meets two  korean soldiers who go along with him  they help a group of commoners whose  carriage is stuck in the muddy path then  ask one of them to bring them to meet  commander yang of ansi to their surprise  the person they are helping is commander  yang himself who stays composed despite  being suspicious of them  yang's men check the soldiers horses and  deduce that they are taizon spies then  kill them swiftly  samul however manages to explain that he  came from ansi the last of the yuubal  clan  he claims to flee from the chinese army  and decides to stand with the antsy  people yang decides not to kill him but  ties him up and will interrogate him  later inside the fortress they then move  to ansi a lively town hidden behind the  fortress  a brawl occurs in the market between  huabo and pong two of yang's trusted men  yang resolves the fight by telling the  men to mind their own business  jualbo who is proficient with axes must  continue his work to repair the fortress  wall with his men  back at his house yang tells samol that  he knows young labeled him a traitor and  questions samal's motives to serve him  in ansi he then introduces samuel to his  second in command chu as well as huabo  and pong  he then assigns samuel to be his flag  bearer being close to him at all times  to notify his position during the battle  later that night samuel stalks him  visiting the house of a newborn baby who  is named after himself  samuel realizes how loved commander yang  is by the antsy people the next day  samuel asks chu what kind of leader  general yang is to which he replies that  the people like to think of the general  as the antsy fortress itself  ansi will not be the same without him he  says  general yang looks for paso the leader  of the cavalry who turns ou