 and firebows  yang instructs his men to ready the oil  pouches and burns the siege towers by  hitting them himself  he is hit by a spear and is almost  killed but somal defends him  after four days he wakes up relieving  the whole town  chu and the others who have doubted  samal's loyalty now respect him as he  saved yang  although the town rejoices from  surviving another assault emperor tai  zhong made the holy medium for seance's  future  based on that prophecy the chinese army  builds a mound of dirt higher than the  fortress so they can attack it from the  same level  the holy medium is then sent to antsy to  deliver the ancient bow and bring the  message to surrender  receiving the message samol suggests  asking for reinforcements from the  capital but the men doubt reinforcements  will come  aso suggests they strike emperor tai  zhong directly while the mound is still  constructed as the army is not too  concerned about security although becca  strongly disagrees with the notion no  one can deny that it is the only way  they can try  paso and his men ride to emperor  taizhong's encampment but the ambush is  detected so they are trapped  paso manages to come back to the  commander before his last breath  they learn that the holy medium has  alerted emperor tai zhong about the  ambush she explains that there will be  no way for antsy to win except by  surrendering to emperor tai zhang as she  has seen the doom future  samuel slits her throat refusing to  believe that ansi will fall  consumed by grief becca aims to kill  emperor tai zhang by herself but is also  defeated her body is returned to the  fortress so general yang can properly  bury beckha and paso together  he decides to float their bodies down  the river samul decides to go to general  yun  he begs for general yun to help antsy  people because although yang can be seen  as a traitor he and antsy people are  still kokurya people and they fight  valiantly for the country meanwhile yang  gets an idea t